### 1. Get all products
GET http://localhost:3000/products

### 2. Search products by name (Query String)
GET http://localhost:3000/products?search=keyboard

### 3. Sort products by price ascending (Query String)
GET http://localhost:3000/products?sort=price_asc

### 4. Sort products by price descending (Query String)
GET http://localhost:3000/products?sort=price_desc

### 5. Get single product by ID (Found - 200 OK)
GET http://localhost:3000/products/1

### 6. Get single product by ID (Not Found - 404)
GET http://localhost:3000/products/9999

### 7. Create a new product (Success - 201 Created)
POST http://localhost:3000/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Gaming Monitor 27 inch",
  "price": 249.99,
  "quantity": 3
}

### 8. Create a new product (Validation Error - 400 Bad Request)
POST http://localhost:3000/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "price": -10
}

### 9. Update an existing product (Success - 200 OK)
PUT http://localhost:3000/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ergonomic Wireless Mouse",
  "price": 34.99,
  "quantity": 10
}

### 10. Update a non-existent product (404 Not Found)
PUT http://localhost:3000/products/9999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ghost Item",
  "price": 100
}

### 11. Delete an existing product (Success - 200 OK)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/products/2

### 12. Delete a non-existent product (404 Not Found)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/products/9999

